{"sha": "7c3c7da9ed54c9504a43a929243f2e65ad4f2e373d5081644fbced759c9b4199", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "对各分量求导：$\\dd\\vect e_r/\\dd t = \\dot\\theta(-\\sin\\theta\\,", "\\vect e_x + \\cos\\theta\\,\\vect e_y) = \\dot\\theta\\vect e_\\theta$，且", "对 $\\vect e_\\theta$ 同理。旋转单位矢量的导数", "与其垂直，模等于角速率。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[柱坐标中的速度与加速度]\\label{thm:b1:point-kinematics:cylindrical}", "\\[", "\\vect v = \\dot r\\,\\vect e_r + r\\dot\\theta\\,\\vect e_\\theta + \\dot z\\,\\vect e_z,", "\\qquad", "\\vect a = \\big(\\ddot r - r\\dot\\theta^2\\big)\\vect e_r", "+ \\big(r\\ddot\\theta + 2\\dot r\\dot\\theta\\big)\\vect e_\\theta + \\ddot z\\,\\vect e_z .", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "对 $\\vect{OM} = r\\vect e_r + z\\vect e_z$ 利用引理求导：", "$\\vect v = \\dot r\\vect e_r + r\\dot\\theta\\vect e_\\theta + \\dot z\\vect e_z$.", "再次求导：$\\ddot r\\vect e_r + \\dot r\\dot\\theta\\vect e_\\theta +", "\\dot r\\dot\\theta\\vect e_\\theta + r\\ddot\\theta\\vect e_\\theta - r\\dot\\theta^2", "\\vect e_r + \\ddot z\\vect e_z$，合并同类项。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=1cm, y=1cm]", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (0,0) -- (5.2,0) node[right] {$x$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (0,0) -- (0,3.6) node[above] {$y$};", "  \\node[below left] at (0,0) {$O$};", "  \\coordinate (M) at (35:3.4);", "  \\draw[omExo] (0,0) -- (M); \\fill[omThm] (M) circle (1.6pt); \\node[below right, xshift=2pt] at (M) {$M$};", "  \\node[omExo] at (20:1.9) {$r$};", "  \\draw (0.9,0) arc (0:35:0.9); \\node at (17:1.15) {$\\theta$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, very thick] (M) -- ++(35:1.1) node[right] {$\\vect e_r$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, very thick] (M) -- ++(125:1.0) node[left] {$\\vect e_\\theta$};", "  % trajectory sketch: spiral", "  \\draw[omThm, thick, domain=5:75, samples=50, variable=\\t] plot ({(2.2+0.0343*\\t)*cos(\\t)},{(2.2+0.0343*\\t)*sin(\\t)});", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (M) -- ++(100:1.6) node[above right] {$\\vect v$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 极坐标：局部基 $(\\vect e_r, \\vect e_\\theta)$", "随 $M$ 转动；速度有径向分量 $\\dot r$ 和", "横向分量 $r\\dot\\theta$。此处轨迹（红色）向外螺旋，", "故 $\\dot r > 0$，$\\vect v$ 向外偏离", "圆的切线方向。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{corollary}[圆周运动]\\label{cor:b1:point-kinematics:circular}", "\\index{圆周运动}\\index{向心加速度}\\index{角速度}", "在半径为 $R$ 的圆上（$r = R$，$z = 0$），取 \\emph{角", "速度} $\\omega = \\dot\\theta$：", "\\[", "\\vect v = R\\omega\\,\\vect e_\\theta, \\qquad", "\\vect a = -R\\omega^2\\,\\vect e_r + R\\dot\\omega\\,\\vect e_\\theta", "= -\\frac{v^2}{R}\\,\\vect e_r + \\frac{\\dd v}{\\dd t}\\,\\vect e_\\theta .", "\\]", "对 \\emph{匀速} 圆周运动（$\\omega$ 为常数），加速度", "完全是 \\emph{向心的}，模为 $v^2/R = R\\omega^2$，", "尽管速率保持不变。", "\\end{corollary}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "在定理中令 $\\dot r = \\ddot r = 0$；此时 $v = R\\omega$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[两个圆周运动]\\label{ex:b1:point-kinematics:circles}", "一辆汽车绕半径为 \\qty{20}{m} 的环岛行驶，速率为 \\qty{36}{km/h}", "（\\qty{10}{m/s}）：$a = v^2/R = \\qty{5.0}{m/s^2}$，即半个 $g$，方向", "指向圆心 --- 轮胎必须提供的力。月球", "（$R = \\qty{3.84e8}{m}$，$T = \\qty{27.3}{d}$）：$\\omega = 2\\pi/T =", "\\qty{2.66e-6}{rad/s}$，$a = R\\omega^2 = \\qty{2.7e-3}{m/s^2}$，", "即 $3600$ 分之一个地表 $g$，距地心六十个地球半径 ---", "牛顿所作的比较（见\\cref{ch:b1:central-forces}）。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{球坐标}", "", "\\begin{definition}[球坐标]\\label{def:b1:point-kinematics:spherical}", "\\index{球坐标}", "点 $M$ 的位置由其到原点的距离 $r = OM$、\\emph{余纬}", "$\\theta \\in [0, \\pi]$（$\\vect{OM}$ 与 $\\vect e_z$ 的夹角）以及", "\\emph{方位角} $\\varphi$（其在 $xy$ 平面上的投影）确定：", "$\\vect{OM} = r\\,\\vect e_r$，其中", "\\[", "\\vect e_r = \\sin\\theta\\cos\\varphi\\,\\vect e_x + \\sin\\theta\\sin\\varphi\\,\\vect e_y + \\cos\\theta\\,\\vect e_z ;", "\\]", "$\\vect e_\\theta$（与经线相切，指向 $\\theta$ 增大的方向）", "与 $\\vect e_\\varphi$（与纬线相切）一起构成局部", "正交归一基。在地球上，$\\theta$ 为 $90^\\circ$ 减去", "纬度，$\\varphi$ 为经度。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[球坐标中的速度]\\label{prop:b1:point-kinematics:sphericalv}", "\\[", "\\vect v = \\dot r\\,\\vect e_r + r\\dot\\theta\\,\\vect e_\\theta + r\\sin\\theta\\,\\dot\\varphi\\,\\vect e_\\varphi .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$\\dd\\vect e_r/\\dd t = \\dot\\theta\\,\\vect e_\\theta + \\sin\\theta\\,\\dot\\varphi\\,", "\\vect e_\\varphi$：第一项为经线面内的转动", "（与极坐标情形相同），第二项是绕 $\\vect e_z$ 的转动，角速率为", "$\\dot\\varphi$，作用于到轴距离为", "$\\sin\\theta$ 的矢量。于是 $\\vect v = \\dd(r\\vect e_r)/\\dd t$。", "本学年不需要加速度。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=1cm, y=1cm, scale=0.95]", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (0,0) -- (-2.4,-0.96) node[below left] {$x$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (0,0) -- (4.2,0) node[right] {$y$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (0,0) -- (0,3.6) node[above] {$z$};", "  \\node[below right] at (0,0) {$O$};", "  \\coordinate (M) at (1.4,2.4);", "  \\coordinate (P) at (1.4,-0.3);", "  \\draw[omExo] (0,0) -- (M); \\fill[omThm] (M) circle (1.6pt); \\node[above left] at (M) {$M$};", "  \\draw[dashed] (M) -- (P); \\draw[dashed] (0,0) -- (P);", "  \\node[omExo] at (0.45,1.45) {$r$};", "  \\draw (0,1.0) arc (90:60:1.0); \\node at (0.3,1.25) {$\\theta$};", "  \\draw (-0.74,-0.3) arc (202:348:0.8); \\node at (0.15,-1.05) {$\\varphi$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, very thick] (M) -- ++(0.45,0.77) node[above] {$\\vect e_r$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, very thick] (M) -- ++(0.77,-0.45) node[right] {$\\vect e_\\theta$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, very thick] (M) -- ++(0.84,0.33) node[right] {$\\vect e_\\varphi$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}